      "cooked": "<p>More updates from Christopher and a tentative schedule to return to normal recording.  Always subject to change if there is an opening for surgery for Christopher</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-76\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-76\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1a6627793cbae4ecf7bc1ded6dbf80eff1ff26ff.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-76\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Editor's Note #76</a></h3>\n\n  <p>The most normal episode in weeks! And we did it live! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:48:25 Medical updates, schedule updates, plans, hopes, dreams, and whiteboard drawings. What more could you ask for? What's that you say? Questions, answered live? Yeah,...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Tentative upcoming schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday, March 5th: <strong>probably</strong> Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#275</span> - Writers’ Room: Choke in Megalopolis</li>\n<li>Tuesday, March 12th: <strong>maybe</strong> Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#276</span> - Writers’ Room: A Villain romantically involved with a support character</li>\n<li>Tuesday, March 19th: <strong>possibly</strong> Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#77</span>\n</li>\n<li>Tuesday, March 26th: <strong>hopefully</strong> Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#277</span> - Writers’ Room: A Vengeance tie-in story</li>\n</ul>\n<p>These images are in spoiler just incase it might be an item you don’t want to dwell on.</p>\n<details>\n<summary>\nChristopher depicting what his neck currently looks like:</summary>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/527849069a027725613f705ee722bff554c819c3.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/527849069a027725613f705ee722bff554c819c3\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/527849069a027725613f705ee722bff554c819c3_2_376x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"bLyRtE8JAcmDtPARTALoMA4L4L9\" width=\"376\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/527849069a027725613f705ee722bff554c819c3_2_376x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/527849069a027725613f705ee722bff554c819c3_2_564x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/527849069a027725613f705ee722bff554c819c3_2_752x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/527849069a027725613f705ee722bff554c819c3_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">963×1279 75.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\nWhat the proposed solution will look like:</summary>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7b1237a47d97eef30507264f3c2009f28c602652.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/7b1237a47d97eef30507264f3c2009f28c602652\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7b1237a47d97eef30507264f3c2009f28c602652_2_376x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hyJL503ubx4xzJYXsACkFCJtcvU\" width=\"376\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7b1237a47d97eef30507264f3c2009f28c602652_2_376x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7b1237a47d97eef30507264f3c2009f28c602652_2_564x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7b1237a47d97eef30507264f3c2009f28c602652_2_752x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7b1237a47d97eef30507264f3c2009f28c602652_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">963×1279 74.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n</details>\n<p>Christopher also showed off some postcards he received:<br>\n<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/01172203649a1a6defbf6ebc05993e77989841f8.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"9E2rsYtOs9LsYhvo1j0rCyNoco\" width=\"292\" height=\"220\"><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/196e6980c1c583241a9a13b79a2e50e26f612670.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/196e6980c1c583241a9a13b79a2e50e26f612670\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/196e6980c1c583241a9a13b79a2e50e26f612670_2_664x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3CYuBy4r9KLT2d2evsXkKAIh3xK\" width=\"664\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/196e6980c1c583241a9a13b79a2e50e26f612670_2_664x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/196e6980c1c583241a9a13b79a2e50e26f612670_2_996x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/196e6980c1c583241a9a13b79a2e50e26f612670_2_1328x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/196e6980c1c583241a9a13b79a2e50e26f612670_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1699×1279 275 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
