      "cooked": "<p>Glad to hear that surgery is on the horizon, and it sounds less devastating than I’d feared it would be.</p>\n<p>The Guise question actually brings up a slightly more serious version…</p>\n<p>Has a <em>vampire</em> ever drunk from Guise? Those fake plantpires didn’t succeed, so we don’t have an answer on that front, but what would happen if a vampire tried to drink Guise’s “blood”?</p>",
