      "cooked": "<p>Christopher really likes to hear the phrase “it’s amazing that you’re even alive” and interpret it as “the human mind has incredible over-matter powers”, as opposed to “medical science understands the body way less well than we like to think it does”.</p>\n<p>“Yes which is in fact no.” Lol.  That needs to become a meme.</p>",
